Benchmark datasets
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The benchmark datasets are not distributed with this repository. They are
obtained locally by the user (see bench/README.md) and stay untracked; no
dataset content is committed. They are the TOSCA high-resolution pairs, and the
paired shapes used here follow the train/test split published with the Sumner &
Popovic deformation-transfer data. Cite the original dataset publications when
publishing results measured on them.
